# files cannot be confused with the gate's 31 / 41 / 51 in Files\replay (compare.py reads ids from the run files).
# Checks: seed_ and orders_ files equal the gate's (eurusd_holdout_p4) but for the id (the same inits); sessions file equal;
# run files 24 columns; swaps.csv equal to the gate's through 2026.10.14, then 15-21 Oct from the new archives.
